      "prompt": "Two similar rectangles have a scale factor of 2 : 3 (small : large). The small one has an area of 20 in². What is the area of the large one in in²?",
      "answer": "45",
      "acceptable": [],
      "check": "20 * (3 / 2) ** 2",
      "hints": [
        "Areas do not scale by k. They scale by k² (k squared).",
